1-Methoxy-4-((1S,2S)-2-(4-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl)cyclopropyl)benzene
(8d) The product was prepared by the general procedure C using 254 mg of
6d (0.75 mmol). The crude product was purified by flash chromatography
(19:1 Hexanes/EtOAc) affording the title compound (134.5 mg, 92 %) as a
red oil. Rf: 0.23 (9:1 Hexanes/EtOAc). 1H-NMR(CDCl3, 300 MHz): δ
7.60-7.57 (m, 2H), 7.27-7.24 (m, 2H), 7.16-7.11 (m, 2H), 6.94-6.89 (m,
2H), 3.85 (s, 3H), 2.27-2.14 (m, 2H), 1.56-1.45 (m, 2H). 13C-NMR(CDCl3,
75 MHz): δ 158.0, 147.0, 133.7, 127.8 (q, J = 32.2 Hz), 126.9, 125.8,
125.2 (q, J = 3.1 Hz) 124.5 (q, J = 272 Hz), 113.9, 55.2, 28.1, 27.3,
18.2. IR (film): 3004, 117, 1513, 1322, 1246, 1160, 1115, 1066, 1034, 824
cm-1. HRMS (ESI, Pos) calcd for C17H16F3O1 [M+H]+: 293.1148 m/z, found
293.1148 m/z.
