$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure C: Ethyl
4-((1S,2S)-2-(3-chlorophenyl)cyclopropyl)benzoate (8b)
1-Methyl-2-((1S,2S)-2-phenylcyclopropyl)benzene (8a) The product was
synthesized according to the general procedure C using 231 mg of 6a (0.75
mmol). The crude product was purified by flash chromatography (100 %
Hexanes). The title compound (92.8 mg, 89%) was obtained as a clear
color. Rf: 0.15 (100% Hexanes). 1H-NMR(CDCl3, 400 MHz): δ 7.33-7.28 (m,
2H), 7.22-7.08 (m, 7H), 2.35 (s, 3H), 2.23-2.17 (m, 1H), 2.07-2.02 (m,
1H), 1.50-1.45 (m, 1H), 1.41-1.37 (m, 1H). 13C-NMR(CDCl3, 75 MHz): δ
142.9, 140.1, 137.9, 129.7, 128.4, 126.0, 125.8, 125.6 (2C), 125.5, 26.1,
25.9, 19.9, 16.3. IR (film): 3024, 1602, 1490, 1457, 908, 728, 695 cm-1.
HRMS (ESI, Pos) calcd for C16H17 [M+H]+: 209.1333 m/z, found 209.1325
m/z.
